5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"We must ensure the exhibition fits our current team's capacity, not just our dreams.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I am watching the logistics. Past failures were rarely about the art, but the arrival.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Honestly, I want to know what actually made people smile last year, not just the press.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The floor has limits. I need to know what the structure can actually bear before we promise space.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I am curious where the money goes. It feels like it vanishes before the season ends.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, if the structure is weak, we cannot ask the volunteers to do more.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, money is easy to track. Delays are where the reputation dies.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, I agree. If the team is tired, the show feels tired too.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, delays are bad, but a cracked floor is worse. I will check the survey.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, I will look at the invoices. I want to see the quiet leaks.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the volunteer roster. I need to know who is actually there.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will check the lender paperwork. I want to see where the clock stopped.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I will read the visitor comment slips. I want to hear the real voices.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the structural survey. I need to know the weight limits of the bay.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will check the loan transport costs. I want to see the hidden fees.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us see what the numbers say about our people.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,The paperwork will tell us if we are being lied to by the calendar.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,The slips will tell us if we are talking to ourselves.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,The survey will tell me if the building is ready to hold the weight.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Sakura,,The costs will tell me if we are paying for air.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
