60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option A uses our own people. The craftspeople are here. The lab stays quiet.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, Option A has no shipping. No shipping means no delays. It is the only safe choice.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,"@Shizue, Option A is the only one where the room is full of voices. I want that.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, Option A is light. The floor will not care. The bay will not break.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"@Shizue, Option A is the only one where the money stays in the room. No boxes.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, Option B puts the lab in the room. That is asking the one person to do two jobs.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, Option B is a trap. The conservation bench is a promise we cannot keep.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, Option B is a museum about the museum. It is clever, but it is not warm.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, Option B is heavy. The reconstructions are stone. The floor will groan.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shizue, Option B is a money pit. The bench is a cost we cannot see until the invoice.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, Option C is a nightmare. The rigging will break. The lab will be full of repairs.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, Option C is a risk. The rigging is a promise we cannot keep.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"@Sakura, Option C is a dark room. People will not talk in the dark. They will look at the light.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Sakura, Option C is a weight. The rigging is a load. The floor will not hold it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Shizue, Option C is a tax. The rigging is a cost we cannot see until the invoice.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,Option A is the only one that fits the hands we have. Let us choose the people.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shion,,Option A is the only one that arrives on time. Let us choose the safety.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,Option A is the only one that makes people want to stay. Let us choose the warmth.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Misaki,,Option A is the only one the floor can hold. Let us choose the weight.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Sakura,,Option A is the only one that does not hide its costs. Let us choose the money.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
